WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.877 --> 00:00:19.685
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:27.109
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.109 --> 00:00:30.291
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:34.514
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.514 --> 00:00:40.179
Type your PIN.

6
00:00:40.179 --> 00:00:45.659
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.659 --> 00:00:51.381
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

8
00:00:51.381 --> 00:00:56.262
Each row has a pencil beside the name.

9
00:00:56.262 --> 00:01:02.826
Tap it to edit that attendee.

10
00:01:02.826 --> 00:01:07.617
Name, phone and grade all live here.

11
00:01:07.617 --> 00:01:11.646
Clear the old phone number.

12
00:01:11.646 --> 00:01:17.554
Type the new one.

13
00:01:17.554 --> 00:01:22.902
Tap Save.

14
00:01:22.902 --> 00:01:31.567
The attendance history is untouched — it follows the person, not the name.
